---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content'
const testimonials = (await getCollection('testimonial')).sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order).map(t => ({
  name: t.data.name,
  role: t.data.role,
  text: t.data.text,
  avatar: t.data.avatar,
  rating: t.data.rating,
}));
---

<section class="my-16 sm:my-24 py-16 sm:py-20 bg-emerald-50/60 border-y border-emerald-100/80">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">

      <!-- Left Column: Title & Quote intro -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-oren/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-oren mb-3">
          Kata Mereka
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-dark-blue leading-tight">
          Kenapa Memilih Kami?
        </h2>
        <div class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-20 bg-oren rounded-full"></div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Kepercayaan orang tua adalah amanah terbesar bagi kami. Dengarkan penuturan langsung dari para wali murid dan alumni mengenai pengalaman belajar di MIN 2 Kulon Progo.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-4">
          <div class="flex -space-x-2">
            <span class="inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-hijau-600 text-white text-sm font-bold border-2 border-white">S</span>
            <span class="inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-500 text-white text-sm font-bold border-2 border-white">A</span>
            <span class="inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white text-sm font-bold border-2 border-white">R</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">180+ Keluarga Puas</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Mencetak Generasi Berkarakter Sejak 1980</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Testimonial Cards Carousel / Grid -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          {testimonials.slice(0, 2).map((item) => (
            <div class="relative rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-md border border-slate-100 flex flex-col justify-between">
              <div>
                <!-- Stars -->
                <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-sm mb-3">
                  {'★'.repeat(item.rating)}
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm italic text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                  "{item.text}"
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-hijau-100 text-2xl">
                  {item.avatar}
                </span>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm">{item.name}</h4>
                  <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">{item.role}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
